  "content": "\n\n<h2>星雲微光（綠色）</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2>功能特色</h2>\n<h5>（這些功能特色將進一步提升您的原版遊戲體驗）</h5>\n<h5>此模組會將您原版附魔物品與裝備的標準微光，替換為酷炫的深綠色星雲微光，在黑暗中效果尤為出色！建議前往「無障礙設定」將「微光強度」調至 100%，以獲得最佳視覺效果。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>請將檔案放入 resourcepacks 資料夾中，並在遊戲內的資源包選單中啟用。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/863/779/2024-05-10_02.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1857\" height=\"976\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/j58K0FVWknU?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">今天就購買伺服器，與好友一同遊玩！點擊 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a> 或下方橫幅，並使用代碼 <strong>GAMERPOTION</strong> 即可享有 25% 折扣！</span></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.bisecthosting.com%252fgamerpotion\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1068/671/53840b7f-f250-4a97-8995-c3544ae3e296.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1086\" height=\"180\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/uCPfPBvsRJ\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/418/join-discord.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"598\" height=\"187\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fgamerpotion\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/958/419/kofi.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"604\" height=\"165\"></a></p>",
